{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3uNsaWrgSA6tw15xpH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*A heavy wooden door stands before you, ancient and imposing. Iron studs dot its surface in concentric patterns. A rusted keyhole sits at its center, shaped like no key you've ever seen.*\n\n*The lock mechanism groans — something within shifts, tumblers catching on centuries of dust and silence.*\n\n**CLUNK.**\n\n*A thin line of pale light bleeds from the edges. The door shudders but does not open. It waits.*\n\n*You hear, from the other side, breathing that is not yours.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":120,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}